<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Laissez-passer {{ pass.reference }}</title>
<style>
  @page { margin: 18mm 16mm; }
  body { font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #0f1e36; }
  .head { border-bottom: 2px solid #1d3f73; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .logo { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; color: #1d3f73; }
  .logo small { font-size: 9pt; font-weight: normal; color: #56637a; margin-left: 8px; }
  h1 { font-size: 17pt; margin: 0 0 2px; }
  h2 { font-size: 12pt; margin: 16px 0 6px; color: #1d3f73; border-bottom: 1px solid #d2d9e2; padding-bottom: 3px; }
  .ref { font-family: 'DejaVu Sans Mono', monospace; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; }
  table.top { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  table.top td { vertical-align: top; }
  td.qr { width: 52mm; text-align: center; }
  td.qr img { width: 48mm; height: 48mm; }
  .muted { color: #56637a; font-size: 9pt; }
  .plate { display: inline-block; border: 1.5px solid #0f1e36; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 8px; margin-right: 6px; font-family: 'DejaVu Sans Mono', monospace; font-weight: bold; }
  .auth { margin-bottom: 10px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .auth h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; }
  table.zones { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 4px; }
  table.zones td { border-top: 1px solid #d2d9e2; padding: 4px 4px; vertical-align: top; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .state { font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap; }
  .notice { margin-top: 16px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #d2d9e2; background: #f4f6f9; font-size: 9pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="head"><span class="logo">Civipass<small>Laissez-passer</small></span></div>

  <table class="top"><tr>
    <td>
      <div class="ref">{{ pass.reference }}</div>
      <h1>{{ pass.firstName }} {{ pass.lastName|upper }}</h1>
      <p>{{ pass.eventName }}</p>
      <p class="muted">{{ pass.category }} · {{ pass.travelMode == 'vehicle' ? 'Véhicule' : 'À pied / à vélo' }}</p>
      {% if pass.plates|length %}<p>{% for plate in pass.plates %}<span class="plate">{{ plate }}</span>{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
    </td>
    <td class="qr"><img src="{{ qr }}" alt="QR code du laissez-passer {{ pass.reference }}"><div class="muted">À présenter lors d’un contrôle</div></td>
  </tr></table>

  <h2>Communes et zones autorisées</h2>
  {% for authorization in pass.rights.authorizations %}
    <div class="auth">
      <h3>{{ authorization.municipalityName }}</h3>
      <div class="muted">{{ cp_authorization_period(authorization, pass.timezone) }}</div>
      <table class="zones">
        {% for zone in authorization.zones %}
          {% set state = cp_zone_state(zone, pass.timezone) %}
          <tr><td>{{ zone.label }}</td><td class="state">{{ state.label }}</td><td class="muted">{{ state.detail }}</td></tr>
        {% else %}
          <tr><td class="muted">Aucune zone active dans cette autorisation.</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="notice">
    <b>Les droits sont vérifiés au moment du contrôle.</b> Ce document est une photographie de vos droits au {{ generated_at|cp_datetime(pass.timezone) }} (heure de l’événement).
    Si une commune modifie, suspend ou retire des droits ensuite, ce document imprimé ne change pas : le QR code, lui, renvoie toujours vers vos droits actuels.
    Le QR code ne contient ni votre nom ni vos plaques. Dates et heures : fuseau de l’événement ({{ pass.timezone }}).
  </div>
</body>
</html>
